1067	              >
1068	                {c.detail}
1069	              </p>
1070	            </div>
1071	          ))}
1072	
1073	          {/* Printing the nameservers is the point, not decoration: it is how the
1074	              customer (or support) can tell this answer came from the zone's own
1075	              authority and not from a stale recursive cache. */}
1076	          <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-500">
1077	            {report.nameservers.length > 0 ? (
1078	              <>
1079	                Read directly from this domain&apos;s nameservers (
